Aegis
=====

Aegis is a secure remote terminal workspace for AI Coding Agents.

Copyright (c) 2026 Ye Jianbo

This project is based on electerm, an MIT-licensed terminal and file manager
project originally created by ZHAO Xudong.

Upstream project:
https://github.com/electerm/electerm

The upstream electerm license notice is preserved in LICENSE and the archived
upstream README is kept at docs/electerm/README_UPSTREAM.md.

Aegis adds the Rust Agent Gateway, MCP integration, command policy engine,
approval workflow, audit timeline, and human-in-the-loop Agent terminal
controls on top of the electerm desktop codebase.
